'''Revenants''' are variants of Bonies that appear in the {{s|Mausoleum}} and {{s|Gehenna}}. Revenants wander around the room randomly, occasionally stopping to shoot a stream of flames at Isaac. These flames have limited range, and are blocked by [[obstacle]]s.
